about = IcyBoard menu utility
create = Create a menu file
board = BBS directory or board configuration file (optional; otherwise search above the menu file)
check = Check a menu without opening the editor or writing files (errors return exit code 1)
full-screen = Use the full screen (default is 80x25)
version = Print the version and exit
file = File[.mnu] to edit/create (extension will always be .mnu)